{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-14","kind":"proposition","title":"平方数整除与底数整除","englishTitle":"If a square measure a square, the side will also measure the side; and, if the side measure the side, the square will also measure the square.","book":8,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","contentId":"euclid-8-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0301dfb14dcc613f41dea0509cc2c74e9ef9c443320fc14a864f77009138fee9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-14.statement","euclid-8-14.construction.1","euclid-8-14.construction.2","euclid-8-14.proof.1","euclid-8-14.proof.2","euclid-8-14.proof.3","euclid-8-14.proof.4","euclid-8-14.proof.5","euclid-8-14.proof.6","euclid-8-14.conclusion","euclid-8-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6f2c0425f3b4f80b49eb978b22e150ffdf0c1bb31189093f7cc161166dce75e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a square measure a square, the side will also measure the side; and, if the side measure the side, the square will also measure the square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果是平方数 整除 a 平方数, 一方也将是整除;如果是整除, 一方是平方数, 平方数也是整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74b107d05b8f4d640f0c31ffeab545d39f9db563f80ffb92a56ea90193735b0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be square numbers, let C, D be their sides, and let A measure B; I say that C also measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,平方数,C,D成为它们的一面,让A,整除,B;我说,C,整除,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a9a92c710905d9a02281f1f85f39a7902802f5b01820530af3179bf9d69285c","citations":["euclid-8-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let C by multiplying D make E; therefore A, E, B are continuously proportional in the ratio of C to D. [[VIII. 11](/principles/euclid-8-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C和D的产值为E;因此,A、E、B的产值持续为成比例,比例为C至D。 [[VIII. 11](/principles/euclid-8-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b300b82558bff094ecda328ebc62d2bc6992a24547fca699bc8103d33e5e72b","citations":["euclid-8-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A, E, B are continuously proportional, and A measures B, therefore A also measures E. [[VIII. 7](/principles/euclid-8-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,E,B 持续成比例,A 整除 B,A,成比例,A,整除,E。 [[VIII. 7](/principles/euclid-8-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25dac64f293cfd982189d2ddfff5836ae4068fae35562816dfa99ed50f510d41","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as A is to E, so is C to D; therefore also C measures D. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比E等于C比D,因此也等于C、整除、D；A 与 E 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9671afac329adb71a84ed9035dc35801e07fc6749ed6b1a8bc6e25a2ca6902f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let C measure D; I say that A also measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"再一次,让我们来讨论C 整除 D;我说,A也是整除 B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ae6ce5ab5279d751c8c6b5cce2d89afde39148af1169046606a4b3b82ca691b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, we can in a similar manner prove that A, E, B are continuously proportional in the ratio of C to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的建筑,我们同样可以证明,A,E,B持续为成比例,比例为C与D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d7aa86b230283d476ac461a802551bb883b1992bb324e73d2b1e65e75c55c95","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as C is to D, so is A to E, and C measures D, therefore A also measures E. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C对D的比等于A对E的比,C对整除对D的比,因此A对E的比也等于整除对E的比；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 E 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52b9e97ff8af89e48754e729af8f30b31ad64122b78f66732f5fdd271b9b0af8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And A, E, B are continuously proportional; therefore A also measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,E,B 持续成比例,因此A 也是整除,B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-14.source","contentId":"euclid-8-14","revisionId":"euclid-8-14@raw-0301dfb14dcc613f","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47e2412376144e1ccaf09aca5490632b08b29aa4b3e9ef98079d53ae0194c3b2","citations":[],"sur